{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857140/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.poster.avif?t=1751995354\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857140/extras/bfcaef56e25bef141e79a35415fd473b.apng?t=1751995354\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the official guide for the game &quot;Sapo Xul\u00e9 and the Unwanted Marriage&quot; your adventure through Sap\u00f3polis will be complete! Learn the story of the creator of Sapo Xul\u00e9, details about the creation of the character, remember products launched throughout the more than 30 years of its history and discover the secrets of the game with the mini guide! Embark on this adventure! (Portuguese version only).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: Guide available only in Brazilian Portuguese.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857140?t=1751995354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857140?t=1751995354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857140/15685cc08344f76addf5d2b72c1d7e480dfd7a64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751995354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857140/15685cc08344f76addf5d2b72c1d7e480dfd7a64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751995354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u0